					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750641119,
					"content": "它都冒烟了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750641122
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750641122,
					"content": "呼…它现在…嗯，彻底坏了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750641123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "马尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750641123,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750641124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750641124,
					"content": "嘿，别那样看着我，至少现在我的心情好多了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750641125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "马尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750641125,
					"content": "唉…如你所见，我们的人工光源坏掉了…我可在它身上花了不少摩拉，太让人失望了，就像我的前妻…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750641126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "马尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750641126,
					"content": "好啦，你先打住！不要着急啦，我们来帮忙就好啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750641127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750641127,
					"content": "唉…真不好意思…呼，我需要什么来着？对，需要一个打在暝视龙<color=#00E1FFFF>左侧脸部上</color>的暖光光源，还有一个照亮暝视龙<color=#00E1FFFF>后背轮廓</color>的光源。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750641128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "马尼菲科"
				},
				{
					"id": 750641128,
					"content": "没问题，我们开始吧！",
